<!--
  Example of the standard-only ISO 11783-10 subset used by RoboSoft.

  This file demonstrates the structure of a task with:
  - Farm (FRM), Customer (CTR) and Product (PDT): Master data
  - Partfield (PFD): Field metadata
  - GuidanceGroup/Pattern (GGP/GPN) and GuidanceAllocation (GAN)
  - Coordinates in WGS84 (latitude/longitude/altitude in integer millimetres)

  Attribute mapping (ISO 11783 standard):
  - Point (PNT): A=type, B=designator, C=north, D=east, E=up
  - Farm (FRM): A=id, B=designator, H=country
  - Customer (CTR): A=id, B=name
  - Product (PDT): A=id, B=name
  - Partfield (PFD): A=id, B=optional code, C=designator, D=area,
    E=optional customer reference, F=optional farm reference
  - OperationTechnique (OTQ): A=id, B=designator
  - CulturalPractice (CPC): A=id, B=designator
-->
